	~%100%ὡς#Correct: **ὡς** → “in order that” (Chapter 8).
	~%-100%παρά + acc#Incorrect. **παρά + acc** means “to the side of” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%μετά + gen.#Incorrect. **μετά + gen.** means “with” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%σύv + dative#Incorrect. **σύv + dative** means “with” (Chapter 4).
}


::Q040::[markdown]ἀντί + gen:{
	~%-100%from#Incorrect. **ἐκ + gen; ἐξ + gen** means “from” (Chapter 1).
	~%-100%at the side of#Incorrect. **παρά + dat** means “at the side of” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%under#Incorrect. **ὑπὸ + gen** means “under” (Chapter 5).
	~%-100%by (personal agent)#Incorrect. **ὑπὸ + gen** means “by (personal agent)” (Chapter 5).
	~%100%instead of#Correct: **ἀντί + gen** → “instead of” (Chapter 3).
}


